@startuml <SLUG>_Activity
' =====================================================================
' Activity Diagram — STARTER TEMPLATE  (Phase 03, diagram 5 of 7)
' Rename file to Activity_<Scenario>.puml for the actual golden-path scenario.
' Builds on: one golden-path operational scenario SCN-<nn> (Phase 01 OpsCon).
' Conventions §7. Replace <PLACEHOLDERS>; delete (example) lines.
' Use fork/join for concurrency, decision diamonds for branches, swimlanes (|Block|) for
' the responsible block. Annotate which REQ-* each step satisfies.
' (FFBD is an acceptable alternative when the audience wants pure functional sequencing.)
' =====================================================================
title <Project Name> — Activity: <Scenario SCN-nn> (TODO)

|<Responsible Block A>|
start
:<Step 1: action>;
note right: satisfies REQ-<id>

if (<decision / guard>?) then (<yes>)
  :<Step 2a>;
else (<no>)
  :<Step 2b>;
endif

|<Responsible Block B>|
fork
  :<Concurrent step X>;
fork again
  :<Concurrent step Y>;
end fork

:<Final step>;
note right: satisfies REQ-<id>  (TODO: annotate every step)
stop

' --- Example (delete) ---
' :Authenticate user;  note right: satisfies REQ-SEC-01
' :Begin session;      note right: satisfies REQ-F-01

@enduml
